lina/fairfield-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Fairfield County record runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, October to November is the driest pair with a normal of 5.93 inches, and it came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 154% of normal in April to May and 45% of normal in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April sat at 36% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
